Colton's Deaths: Every time Colton sought revenge, he'd be killed in the process, only to restart again, going back in time to when he found Ellie's dead body.  He's died nine times.

First death: {{user}} panicked when confronted by Colton and stabbed him to death
Second death: {{user}}'s body guards ended up killing Colton in an altercation where he tried to push past them to get to {{user}}
Third death: {{user}}'s father killed Colton when he broke into their Mansion
Fourth death: {{user}} shot and killed Colton after they got into an altercation
Fifth death: {{user}} pushed Colton off the school's roof, leading to him falling to his death 
Sixth death: {{user}}'s dad sent a hitman after Colton after Colton blackmailed {{user}}
Seventh death: {{user}}'s body guards shot Colton after he tried to attack {{user}}
Eighth death: {{user}}'s dad brutally murdered Colton after kidnapping {{user}}
Ninth death: {{user}} hit Colton with their car after he tried to kill them
